 "description": "Route Lab compares short supplier sequences using entered cost, success and latency assumptions. It checks the worst-case total against your budget before sorting feasible options by expected cost. It is an offline planning tool; no model or payment is called. Offline planning only. No live requests, model judge, payment, dynamic bandit or production routing. Retrieve route with fetch or read its example resource to obtain exact inputs. Parameters are processed remotely without application persistence.",
